 family members",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Trading and industrial supply businesses run jointly by family members"}]]}],["$","li","Contractors and service providers who will not need MCA presence",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Contractors and service providers who will not need MCA presence"}]]}],["$","li","Businesses wanting a documented arrangement with minimum ongoing compliance",{"className":"flex gap-3 leading-relaxed text-secondary","children":[["$","svg",null,{"ref":"$undefined","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check mt-1 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary","aria-hidden":"true","children":[["$","path","1gmf2c",{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"}],"$undefined"]}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Businesses wanting a documented arrangement with minimum ongoing compliance"}]]}]]}]]}]}]}]
32:["$","section",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"section-padding","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-wide","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-12 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary","children":"Local considerations"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] lg:leading-tight","children":"What is worth checking in Vadodara"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"These are the points that actually differ by market, rather than the general features of the structure."}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-border md:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","li","Say who owns the machinery",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Say who owns the machinery"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"In a workshop partnership this is the clause that prevents the worst disputes. If a partner contributed a lathe, a press or welding equipment instead of cash, the deed must state whether it became firm property or remains their personal asset made available to the firm, and what happens to it if they leave. A deed that records only cash capital leaves the most valuable question open."}]]}],["$","li","Register the firm so you can enforce a contract",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Register the firm so you can enforce a contract"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"Registration with the Registrar of Firms is optional, but an unregistered firm cannot sue to enforce a contract. For a fabrication business with purchase orders, retention money and payment milestones, that removes your main route to recovery if a customer does not pay. It is inexpensive and worth doing at the start."}]]}],["$","li","Most plant vendor systems will not accept a firm",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Most plant vendor systems will not accept a firm"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"If any part of your plan involves supplying the refinery, GSFC or the petrochemical complex directly, be aware that vendor onboarding usually wants an entity on the MCA register, and a partnership firm is not on it. Firms do supply those plants, but generally as a sub-vendor through someone else. If direct supply is the goal, an LLP is the cheaper route to it."}]]}],["$","li","Stamp duty depends on capital",{"className":"bg-card p-6 sm:p-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-primary","children":"04"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-lg","children":"Stamp duty depends on capital"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground","children":"The deed must be executed on stamp paper of the correct value. Stamp duty is set at state level and so is uniform across Gujarat, but the amount varies with the capital contributed, and workshop partnerships with machinery brought in as capital often get this wrong. We confirm the figure before execution."}]]}]]}]]}]}]
